<title>SINGAPORE: Koh Brothers first half up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Koh Brothers first half up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in million of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  2.36  vs  1.85</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    0.99  vs  0.78</p>
<p>    Turnover		  118.42  vs 90.44</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  0.83  vs  0.58</p>
<p>    Associates		 (0.16) vs  0.04</p>
<p>    Pretax			3.99  vs  3.49</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.73  vs  1.63</p>
<p>    Minorities		  0.09  vs (0.13)</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Koh Brothers Group Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds</p>
</text>
